Files: extension/external/*
Copyright: 2018-2026 Stichting DuckDB Foundation
License: MIT
Comment: The pre-vendor script vendors the out-of-tree DuckDB extensions
 that are statically linked into the CLI (duckdb-httpfs, duckdb-postgres,
 duckdb-mysql, duckdb-sqlite, all MIT-licensed by the DuckDB Foundation),
 pinned to the commits of duckdb v2.0.0's own release configs. The sqlite
 scanner embeds sqlite3, which is in the public domain. Local adaptations
 for the static-link/system-library build are applied by pre-vendor.

